{"about_the_game":"Kingdom Cum: Deep Entrance \ud83c\udff0 \u2014 Demo Version<br><br>Step into a world where power isn't just about strength\u2014it's about cunning, charm, and a bit of risk. Kingdom Cum: Deep Entrance invites you to explore a seductive medieval kingdom where your street-smart skills are your most valuable asset. As a con artist born in the slums, your dreams are big, but the road to wealth and pleasure is paved with deception, desire, and danger.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724170/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1749927543\" /><br>In this demo, you'll get a taste of what it's like to hustle your way through a city where power, lust, and betrayal are the rules of the game. From the dark alleys to the glittering chambers of the elite, your every choice will bring you closer to your goal: a life of luxury, pleasure, and control.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724170/extras/GIF_7.gif?t=1749927543\" /><br>Key Features in the Demo:<br>\ud83c\udccf Hustle Your Way to the Top: Master the art of deception. Whether you're tricking nobles or sweet-talking your way into riches, your wit will be your sharpest weapon.<br>\ud83d\udc8b Steamy Encounters: Get a glimpse into the passionate and uncensored adult scenes that await. Will you seduce your way into the hearts (and beds) of the powerful?<br>\ud83d\udc51 A Dark and Tempting World: Explore a city filled with secrets, gold, and temptation. Dive into shady taverns, attend lavish feasts, and unlock the mysteries hidden in the heart of the kingdom.<br>\ud83d\udd25 Seduction Is Key: Charm, flirt, and manipulate your way into high society. The choices you make will leave a trail of broken hearts and stolen fortunes.<br>\ud83c\udfb2 Risk and Reward: Take chances in high-stakes games. Will you walk away with unimaginable rewards, or will you fall into ruin?<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"http